 this film  it's entirely possible that they may  have even been members of the court of  owls or perhaps supported the  organization's goals knowingly or  unknowingly  alternatively their opposition to the  court's corruption might have  in this movie at least directly led to  their deaths it's got of course you know  action all that kind of stuff but at the  end of it  it also is incredibly personal for him  even though it is the story in which  he's trying to understand and unravel  this mystery  either way the riddler's statement that  you're part of this too implies that the  entire goal of his puzzles might be to  force bruce wayne to confront his  family's dark past  and if this hypothesis actually proves  accurate it still remains to be seen  where the riddler stands on all of this  is he serving the court of owls for  instance or trying to take them down  who knows all of this might be wrong  anyway in the meantime it's fun to  speculate  what does it mean it's a riddle  the batman hits theaters on october 1st  2021.  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

